## Modules

| Module | Contents |
| --- | --- |
| `skrecsys` | `RecommenderMixin`, `is_recommender`, `supports_partial_fit` |
| `skrecsys.base` | `ConditionMixin`, `FeaturesMixin`, `RankerMixin`, `Not`, `AllOf`, `AnyOf`, `is_condition`, `is_features`, `is_ranker`, `serves_unknown_users` |
